WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.700
Question one!

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.500
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.033
Apple...

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:12.600
banana...

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.167
carrot...

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:13.700
grape.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.267
A,

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:14.833
apple...

00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:15.367
B,

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:15.933
banana...

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:16.500
C,

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.033
carrot...

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:18.133
or D,

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:18.700
grape?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.367
Five seconds, go!

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.300
TIME'S UP!

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.400
Pencils down!

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:30.300
The answer is...

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:30.700
C,

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.100
carrot!

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:31.933
An apple,

00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:32.333
banana,

00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:34.400
and grape are all fruits.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.433
A carrot is a vegetable,

00:00:36.433 --> 00:00:38.500
so it does not belong.

00:00:39.633 --> 00:00:40.733
Question two,

00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:42.433
a number series!

00:00:42.433 --> 00:00:42.967
Five,

00:00:42.967 --> 00:00:43.533
ten,

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:44.100
fifteen,

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:44.633
twenty,

00:00:44.633 --> 00:00:45.767
and then...

00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:47.433
what comes next?

00:00:47.433 --> 00:00:48.000
A,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.533
twenty-five...

00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:49.100
B,

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:49.667
thirty...

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:50.233
C,

00:00:50.233 --> 00:00:50.767
twenty-one...

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:51.900
or D,

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.467
twenty-four?

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:53.567
Five seconds!

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:00.467
TIME'S UP!

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:01.567
Pencils down!

00:01:02.233 --> 00:01:02.667
It's...

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:03.133
A,

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:03.567
twenty-five!

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:06.233
Each number goes up by five:

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:06.667
five,

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:07.100
ten,

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:07.567
fifteen,

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:08.000
twenty,

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.667
so the next is twenty plus

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.000
five is twenty-five.

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:14.133
Question three,

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:15.600
a picture puzzle!

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:18.567
An empty circle becomes a filled-in

00:01:18.567 --> 00:01:19.033
circle.

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:21.500
So an empty triangle becomes...

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.500
which one?

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:23.000
A,

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.467
a filled circle...

00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:24.967
B,

00:01:24.967 --> 00:01:26.433
an empty triangle...

00:01:26.433 --> 00:01:26.933
C,

00:01:26.933 --> 00:01:28.400
a filled square...

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.400
or D,

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.867
a filled triangle?

00:01:30.867 --> 00:01:31.833
Five seconds!

00:01:37.633 --> 00:01:38.767
TIME'S UP!

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:39.867
Pencils down!

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:41.767
The answer is...

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:42.200
D,

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.433
a filled triangle!

00:01:43.433 --> 00:01:45.900
The rule is the shape gets

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.367
filled in but stays the same

00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:48.800
shape,

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:51.267
so the empty triangle becomes a

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:52.100
filled triangle.

00:01:53.233 --> 00:01:54.233
Question four,

00:01:54.233 --> 00:01:55.700
a word analogy!

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.667
Hot is to cold,

00:01:57.667 --> 00:01:59.667
as day is to...

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:00.167
what?

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:00.633
A,

00:02:00.633 --> 00:02:01.133
morning...

00:02:01.133 --> 00:02:01.633
B,

00:02:01.633 --> 00:02:02.133
night...

00:02:02.133 --> 00:02:02.633
C,

00:02:02.633 --> 00:02:03.100
sun...

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:04.100
or D,

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:04.600
light?

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:05.600
Five seconds!

00:02:11.367 --> 00:02:12.500
TIME'S UP!

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.600
Pencils down!

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:14.700
It's...

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:15.167
B,

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:15.600
night!

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.867
Hot and cold are opposites,

00:02:17.867 --> 00:02:20.567
so the opposite of day is

00:02:20.567 --> 00:02:21.000
night.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.700
It is the same relationship, flipped.

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:26.000
Question five,

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.733
a number series!

00:02:27.733 --> 00:02:28.300
Two,

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:28.867
four,

00:02:28.867 --> 00:02:29.467
eight,

00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:30.033
sixteen,

00:02:30.033 --> 00:02:31.200
and then...

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.933
what comes next?

00:02:32.933 --> 00:02:33.500
A,

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.067
twenty-four...

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:34.667
B,

00:02:34.667 --> 00:02:35.233
twenty...

00:02:35.233 --> 00:02:35.800
C,

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:36.400
thirty-two...

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.533
or D,

00:02:37.533 --> 00:02:38.133
thirty?

00:02:38.133 --> 00:02:39.267
Five seconds!

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:46.200
TIME'S UP!

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.300
Pencils down!

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:49.467
The answer is...

00:02:49.467 --> 00:02:49.967
C,

00:02:49.967 --> 00:02:50.467
thirty-two!

00:02:50.467 --> 00:02:51.967
Each number doubles:

00:02:51.967 --> 00:02:52.500
two,

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:53.000
four,

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:53.500
eight,

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:54.000
sixteen,

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.000
so the next is sixteen times

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.500
two is thirty-two.

00:02:59.667 --> 00:03:00.633
Question six,

00:03:00.633 --> 00:03:02.100
a word analogy!

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:04.033
Bee is to hive,

00:03:04.033 --> 00:03:06.000
as bird is to...

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:06.467
what?

00:03:06.467 --> 00:03:06.967
A,

00:03:06.967 --> 00:03:07.467
nest...

00:03:07.467 --> 00:03:07.933
B,

00:03:07.933 --> 00:03:08.433
tree...

00:03:08.433 --> 00:03:08.900
C,

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:09.400
egg...

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:10.367
or D,

00:03:10.367 --> 00:03:10.867
sky?

00:03:10.867 --> 00:03:11.833
Five seconds!

00:03:17.633 --> 00:03:18.767
TIME'S UP!

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:19.867
Pencils down!

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:20.867
It's...

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:21.200
A,

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:21.533
nest!

00:03:21.533 --> 00:03:23.567
A bee lives in a hive,

00:03:23.567 --> 00:03:25.600
so a bird lives in a

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:25.933
nest.

00:03:25.933 --> 00:03:27.933
Each one is the home that

00:03:27.933 --> 00:03:28.600
animal builds.

00:03:29.767 --> 00:03:30.900
Question seven,

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.567
a number series!

00:03:32.567 --> 00:03:33.133
One,

00:03:33.133 --> 00:03:33.667
two,

00:03:33.667 --> 00:03:34.233
five,

00:03:34.233 --> 00:03:34.800
ten,

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:35.367
seventeen,

00:03:35.367 --> 00:03:36.467
and then...

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:38.167
what comes next?

00:03:38.167 --> 00:03:38.700
A,

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:39.267
twenty-four...

00:03:39.267 --> 00:03:39.833
B,

00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:40.400
twenty-six...

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:40.933
C,

00:03:40.933 --> 00:03:41.500
twenty-five...

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.633
or D,

00:03:42.633 --> 00:03:43.200
twenty-eight?

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.300
Five seconds!

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:51.233
TIME'S UP!

00:03:51.233 --> 00:03:52.333
Pencils down!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.533
The answer is...

00:03:54.533 --> 00:03:55.067
B,

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:55.567
twenty-six!

00:03:55.567 --> 00:03:58.633
The gaps are the odd numbers

00:03:58.633 --> 00:03:59.167
one,

00:03:59.167 --> 00:03:59.667
three,

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:00.167
five,

00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:00.700
seven,

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:01.733
then nine.

00:04:01.733 --> 00:04:04.800
So seventeen plus nine is twenty-six.

00:04:05.933 --> 00:04:06.967
Question eight,

00:04:06.967 --> 00:04:08.533
a word analogy!

00:04:08.533 --> 00:04:10.600
Fish is to swim,

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.700
as bird is to...

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:13.200
what?

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:13.733
A,

00:04:13.733 --> 00:04:14.267
walk...

00:04:14.267 --> 00:04:14.767
B,

00:04:14.767 --> 00:04:15.300
sing...

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:15.800
C,

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:16.333
hop...

00:04:16.333 --> 00:04:17.367
or D,

00:04:17.367 --> 00:04:17.900
fly?

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:18.933
Five seconds!

00:04:24.733 --> 00:04:25.867
TIME'S UP!

00:04:25.867 --> 00:04:26.967
Pencils down!

00:04:27.633 --> 00:04:28.100
It's...

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:28.600
D,

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:29.067
fly!

00:04:29.067 --> 00:04:31.500
A fish moves by swimming,

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.367
so a bird moves by flying.

00:04:34.367 --> 00:04:37.767
It is how each animal gets around.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.100
Question nine,

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:41.867
a number series!

00:04:41.867 --> 00:04:42.467
Two,

00:04:42.467 --> 00:04:43.067
three,

00:04:43.067 --> 00:04:43.667
five,

00:04:43.667 --> 00:04:44.267
eight,

00:04:44.267 --> 00:04:44.833
thirteen,

00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:46.033
and then...

00:04:46.033 --> 00:04:47.833
what comes next?

00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:48.400
A,

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:49.000
eighteen...

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:49.600
B,

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:50.200
twenty...

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:50.800
C,

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:51.400
twenty-one...

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:52.567
or D,

00:04:52.567 --> 00:04:53.167
twenty-six?

00:04:53.167 --> 00:04:54.367
Five seconds!

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:01.267
TIME'S UP!

00:05:01.267 --> 00:05:02.367
Pencils down!

00:05:03.033 --> 00:05:04.533
The answer is...

00:05:04.533 --> 00:05:05.033
C,

00:05:05.033 --> 00:05:05.533
twenty-one!

00:05:05.533 --> 00:05:08.500
Add the two numbers before it:

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.000
eight plus thirteen is twenty-one.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.467
It is the add-the-last-two pattern.

00:05:14.633 --> 00:05:15.800
Question ten!

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:18.767
Which one does NOT belong?

00:05:18.767 --> 00:05:19.333
Piano...

00:05:19.333 --> 00:05:19.933
guitar...

00:05:19.933 --> 00:05:20.533
drum...

00:05:20.533 --> 00:05:21.100
song.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:21.700
A,

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:22.300
piano...

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:22.867
B,

00:05:22.867 --> 00:05:23.467
guitar...

00:05:23.467 --> 00:05:24.067
C,

00:05:24.067 --> 00:05:24.633
drum...

00:05:24.633 --> 00:05:25.833
or D,

00:05:25.833 --> 00:05:26.400
song?

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.600
Five seconds!

00:05:33.367 --> 00:05:34.500
TIME'S UP!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.600
Pencils down!

00:05:36.267 --> 00:05:36.700
It's...

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.133
D,

00:05:37.133 --> 00:05:37.567
song!

00:05:37.567 --> 00:05:38.467
A piano,

00:05:38.467 --> 00:05:38.900
guitar,

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.533
and drum are all instruments you

00:05:41.533 --> 00:05:41.967
play.

00:05:41.967 --> 00:05:44.600
A song is the music they

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:45.033
make,

00:05:45.033 --> 00:05:47.233
so it does not belong.

00:05:48.367 --> 00:05:49.333
Question eleven,

00:05:49.333 --> 00:05:50.833
a shape puzzle!

00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:52.800
Watch the shapes shrink,

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.233
losing one side each step:

00:05:55.233 --> 00:05:56.233
a hexagon,

00:05:56.233 --> 00:05:57.700
then a pentagon,

00:05:57.700 --> 00:05:59.167
then a square.

00:05:59.167 --> 00:06:01.133
Which shape comes next?

00:06:01.133 --> 00:06:01.633
A,

00:06:01.633 --> 00:06:02.633
a triangle...

00:06:02.633 --> 00:06:03.100
B,

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.100
a square...

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:04.600
C,

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:05.567
a circle...

00:06:05.567 --> 00:06:06.567
or D,

00:06:06.567 --> 00:06:07.533
a pentagon?

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:08.533
Five seconds!

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:15.433
TIME'S UP!

00:06:15.433 --> 00:06:16.533
Pencils down!

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:18.567
The answer is...

00:06:18.567 --> 00:06:19.000
A,

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:19.933
a triangle!

00:06:19.933 --> 00:06:22.633
The sides count down by one:

00:06:22.633 --> 00:06:23.567
hexagon six,

00:06:23.567 --> 00:06:24.467
pentagon five,

00:06:24.467 --> 00:06:25.367
square four,

00:06:25.367 --> 00:06:28.100
so next is the triangle with

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:29.000
three sides.

00:06:30.133 --> 00:06:31.133
Question twelve,

00:06:31.133 --> 00:06:33.133
fill in the blank!

00:06:33.133 --> 00:06:36.133
The library was so quiet that

00:06:36.133 --> 00:06:38.633
even a whisper seemed blank,

00:06:38.633 --> 00:06:41.633
so everyone tried hard not to

00:06:41.633 --> 00:06:43.133
make a sound.

00:06:43.133 --> 00:06:43.633
A,

00:06:43.633 --> 00:06:44.133
heavy...

00:06:44.133 --> 00:06:44.633
B,

00:06:44.633 --> 00:06:45.133
loud...

00:06:45.133 --> 00:06:45.633
C,

00:06:45.633 --> 00:06:46.133
colorful...

00:06:46.133 --> 00:06:47.133
or D,

00:06:47.133 --> 00:06:47.633
expensive?

00:06:47.633 --> 00:06:48.600
Five seconds!

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:55.533
TIME'S UP!

00:06:55.533 --> 00:06:56.633
Pencils down!

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:57.833
It's...

00:06:57.833 --> 00:06:58.333
B,

00:06:58.333 --> 00:06:58.867
loud!

00:06:58.867 --> 00:07:01.467
In a place that quiet,

00:07:01.467 --> 00:07:04.600
even a tiny whisper stands out

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.167
and seems loud.

00:07:06.167 --> 00:07:08.767
Only loud fits the meaning.

00:07:09.933 --> 00:07:10.933
Question thirteen,

00:07:10.933 --> 00:07:12.467
a picture puzzle!

00:07:12.467 --> 00:07:15.533
A dot moves around a square:

00:07:15.533 --> 00:07:16.033
bottom-left,

00:07:16.033 --> 00:07:16.533
top-left,

00:07:16.533 --> 00:07:17.033
top-right...

00:07:17.033 --> 00:07:19.567
where does it jump next?

00:07:19.567 --> 00:07:20.100
A,

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:20.600
top-left...

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.100
B,

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:21.600
bottom-right...

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:22.133
C,

00:07:22.133 --> 00:07:23.133
the center...

00:07:23.133 --> 00:07:24.167
or D,

00:07:24.167 --> 00:07:24.667
bottom-left?

00:07:24.667 --> 00:07:25.667
Five seconds!

00:07:31.467 --> 00:07:32.600
TIME'S UP!

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:33.700
Pencils down!

00:07:34.367 --> 00:07:36.100
The answer is...

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:36.667
B,

00:07:36.667 --> 00:07:37.233
bottom-right!

00:07:37.233 --> 00:07:40.100
The dot steps clockwise corner

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.233
to corner:

00:07:41.233 --> 00:07:41.800
bottom-left,

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:42.400
top-left,

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:42.967
top-right,

00:07:42.967 --> 00:07:46.400
so the next corner is bottom-right.

00:07:47.533 --> 00:07:48.633
Question fourteen,

00:07:48.633 --> 00:07:50.300
a number analogy!

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.967
Two makes three,

00:07:51.967 --> 00:07:53.600
three makes five,

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.267
four makes seven,

00:07:55.267 --> 00:07:56.933
so five makes...

00:07:56.933 --> 00:07:57.467
what?

00:07:57.467 --> 00:07:58.033
A,

00:07:58.033 --> 00:07:58.567
eight...

00:07:58.567 --> 00:07:59.133
B,

00:07:59.133 --> 00:07:59.700
ten...

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.233
C,

00:08:00.233 --> 00:08:00.800
eleven...

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:01.900
or D,

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:02.467
nine?

00:08:02.467 --> 00:08:03.567
Five seconds!

00:08:09.333 --> 00:08:10.467
TIME'S UP!

00:08:10.467 --> 00:08:11.567
Pencils down!

00:08:12.233 --> 00:08:12.667
It's...

00:08:12.667 --> 00:08:13.100
D,

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:13.533
nine!

00:08:13.533 --> 00:08:16.133
Each number is doubled then take

00:08:16.133 --> 00:08:17.000
away one:

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.167
five times two is ten,

00:08:19.167 --> 00:08:20.933
minus one is nine.

00:08:22.067 --> 00:08:22.967
Last one,

00:08:22.967 --> 00:08:23.900
question fifteen,

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.233
a number puzzle,

00:08:25.233 --> 00:08:26.600
and it's sneaky!

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:29.333
If two plus three makes ten,

00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:31.600
four plus one makes ten,

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:33.900
five plus two makes fourteen,

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.167
then three plus four makes...

00:08:36.167 --> 00:08:36.600
what?

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:37.067
A,

00:08:37.067 --> 00:08:37.533
seven...

00:08:37.533 --> 00:08:37.967
B,

00:08:37.967 --> 00:08:38.433
twelve...

00:08:38.433 --> 00:08:38.900
C,

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:39.333
fourteen...

00:08:39.333 --> 00:08:40.267
or D,

00:08:40.267 --> 00:08:40.700
twenty-four?

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:41.633
Five seconds!

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.533
TIME'S UP!

00:08:48.533 --> 00:08:49.633
Pencils down!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.533
The answer is...

00:08:51.533 --> 00:08:51.933
C,

00:08:51.933 --> 00:08:52.333
fourteen!

00:08:52.333 --> 00:08:54.800
The trick is to add the

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:55.633
two numbers,

00:08:55.633 --> 00:08:56.433
then double:

00:08:56.433 --> 00:08:58.467
three plus four is seven,

00:08:58.467 --> 00:09:00.933
and seven times two is fourteen.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:02.500
So,

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.533
are you smart or fart?

00:09:04.533 --> 00:09:06.967
Count up your correct answers to

00:09:06.967 --> 00:09:08.167
find your rank!

00:09:09.333 --> 00:09:09.700
So,

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:11.133
how did you do?

00:09:11.133 --> 00:09:12.600
Comment your score below,

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:14.067
and subscribe for more!
